id: xncp_macros
label: XNCP Macros
package: custom
description: The `#[xncp_command]` and `xncp_feature!` proc macros, re-exported by xncp_core
category: Zigbee|NCP
quality: production
provides:
  - name: xncp_macros
template_contribution:
  - name: ohf_rust_component
    value: xncp_macros

metadata:
  rust:
    crate:
      path: rust/xncp_macros
